# Every database is local except seed.db, and the journal files sqlite leaves
# beside one. seed.db is content with no players in it, rebuilt by
# `yarn db:seed-file`; dev.db is your own play data, and backup.db is a snapshot
# pulled off the server — real player data that does not belong in a public
# repository. Start a fresh clone with `yarn db:init`.
*.db
!seed.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
